 Event Toronto
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Women in Business Networking Group (TWIB)\n\\*\\*To at
 tend\, you must **PURCHASE A TICKET** here: [https://gtapreneurs.com/netwo
 rking-events-toronto](https://gtapreneurs.com/networking-events-toronto)\n
 \nDo you want more clients? Join us for GTApreneurs October 14-2026 Aftern
 oon Virtual Business Networking Event to connect with other amazing entrep
 reneurs\, learn something new and promote your business!\n\n**WARM-UP ITIN
 ERARY:**\n\n* **[11:45am-12pm: Pre-event networking]**\n* **12:00-12:10pm:
 ** GTApreneurs welcoming presentation\n* **12:10-12:30pm:** Tammy Defoe Pr
 esentation\, ***“You Never Get a 2nd Chance to Make a 1st Impression?”
 ***\n* **12:30-1:00pm:** Elevator Pitches (45 seconds each)\nFree\n\n**PRE
 MIUM EVENT ITINERARY:**\n\n* **[11:45am-12pm: Pre-event networking]**\n* *
 *12:00-12:10pm:** GTApreneurs welcoming presentation\n* **12:10-12:30pm:**
  Tammy Defoe Presentation\, ***“You Never Get a 2nd Chance to Make a 1st
  Impression?”***\n* **12:30-1:00pm:** Elevator Pitches (45 seconds each)
 \n* **1:00-2:00pm:** Breakout rooms (Network 1-1 with other guests)\n\n**T
 ICKETS**\n**GTApreneurs' Referral Group\, Exhibitor and Mega Networking Me
 mbers:** Free\n**Non-members:** $10\n\\*Premium ticket includes Guest Cont
 act sheet emailed to you after the event. Note: You must attend the event 
