DESCRIPTION:Toronto Women in Business Networking Group (TWIB)\n\\*\\*To at
 tend\, you must **PURCHASE A TICKET** here: https://gtapreneurs.com/busine
 ss-networking-events-pickering\n\nJoin us for an exciting Business Network
 ing Event at Portly Piper Pub Ajax on Thursday October 15\, 2026 where you
  can mix n mingle with other friendly entrepreneurs and small business own
 ers and engage in 3-minute intervals of Speed Networking! This is an outst
 anding opportunity for you to meet potential clients and referral partners
  and promote your business.\n\n***Appetizers provided. \\*Cash bar.***\n\n
 * **TIME:** 6:00-8:00pm\n* **VENUE:** Portly Piper Pub Ajax\n* **ADDRESS:*
 * 235 Bayly St W\, Ajax\, ON\n* **PARKING:** Free\, onsite\, park in front
  of the main entrance\n\n**EVENT ITINERARY:**\n\n* **6:00-7:00pm:** Open n
 etworking + appetizers + buy your own beverage\n* **7:00-8:00pm:** 1-1 Spe
 ed networking (3 minutes/pair then rotate)\n\n**TICKETS**\n\n* **GTApreneu
 rs' Referral Group\, Exhibitor and Mega Networking Members:** Free\n* **No
 n-members:** $22 in advance or $25 on event day\n\n**QUESTIONS ABOUT THE E
