SUMMARY:GTApreneurs BizX 2026 Business Expo and Conference – VIP Ticket
DESCRIPTION:Toronto Women in Business Networking Group (TWIB)\n\\*\\*To at
 tend\, you must **PURCHASE A TICKET** here: [https://gtapreneurs.com/bizx-
 business-expo-toronto](https://gtapreneurs.com/bizx-business-expo-toronto)
 \n\nYou are invited to an exciting mega networking bash! Join us on **Tues
 day\, October 20\, 2026** for **GTApreneurs’** **BizX 2026 Business Expo
  and Conference!** We expect 300+ small business owners and entrepreneurs 
 all looking to meet you and many others to do business together!\n\n**VENU
 E:** Hazelton Manor\n**ADDRESS:** 99 Peelar Rd\, Vaughan\, ON\n**PARKING:*
 * Free\, onsite\n\n**VIP Ticket Itinerary:**\n\n* **9:00-10:30am:** CONTIN
 ENTAL BREAKFAST and Open Networking + visit Lobby & Conference Room Exhibi
 tors\n* **10:30-10:45am:** GTApreneurs welcoming presentation\n* **10:45-1
 1:00am:** Platinum and Gold Sponsor Introductions\n* **11:00-11:20am:** **
 Nile Saïd** presentation\, ***"Your Business Has A Tell"***\n* **11:20-11
 :40am:** **Angie Nezarati** presentation\, ***“Your income works\, your 
 capital doesn’t – yet”***\n* **11:40-12:00pm: Muhammad Murtaza Khan*
 * presentation\, ***“Stop Guessing\, Start Growing: The Strategic Power 
 of Cash Flow Forecasting.”***\n* **12:15- 2:00pm:** VIP Lunch\n* **1:00-
 4:30pm:** BizX 2026 Business Expo (Main expo room)\n* **2:30-2:50pm:** **B
 runo Teixeira** presentation\, ***"Where does AI actually save you hours?
 ”***\n* **2:50-3:10pm:** **Helen Ching** presentation\, ***“Early bird
  gets the worm. Early planning accumulates significant business wealth.”
 ***\n* **4:30-5:00pm:** *Awards Ceremony:* ***Draw and awards*** given for
  **door prizes\, BizX 2026 Expo Contest and Exhibitor Draw**\n\n\\*\\*Snac
 ks and refreshments served 1:00-4:30pm\n\n**VIP Ticket:**\n\n* $59 in adva
 nce or $69 on event day\n* GTApreneurs' Referral Group\, Exhibitor and Meg
 a Networking Members: Free\n\n**Not a member?** Join us today >> [https://
 gtapreneurs.com/business-networking-memberships](https://gtapreneurs.com/b
 usiness-networking-memberships)\n\n**Book an exhibitor table at BizX 2026\
 ,** click here >> [https://gtapreneurs.com/product/bizx2026-business-expo-
 exhibitor](https://gtapreneurs.com/product/bizx2026-business-expo-exhibito
 r)\n\n**Sponsor BizX 2026**\, send us a message >> info@gtapreneurs.com\n\
 n**DOOR PRIZE RAFFLE:** Bring your business card and drop it in the box fo
 r a chance to win a great prize.\n\n**BIZX 2026 BUSINESS EXPO CONTEST:** E
 ach time you visit an exhibitor\, and exchange business cards (or exchange
  information electronically)\, they will put a sticker on your event map. 
 Fill your map with a sticker from every exhibitor to win a prize. At the e
 nd of the day (4:30-5:00pm)\, we will announce Expo Contest winners as wel
 l as guest door prize winners and exhibitor draw winners.\n\n**SPONSORED B
 Y:**\n\n* **Angie Nezarati**\, Everyday Business\, [www.everydaybusiness.c
 a](www.everydaybusiness.ca)\n* **Balbir Pabila**\, PPLSI\\~LegalShield\, [
 https://bkpabila.legalshieldassociate.com](https://bkpabila.legalshieldass
 ociate.com)\n* **Bruno Teixeira**\, Aegis AI & Analytics Advisory\, [https
 ://aegisaianalytics.ca](https://aegisaianalytics.ca)\n* **Dana Thomson**\,
  ADP\, [www.adp.com](www.adp.com)\n* **Helen Ching**\, Monai Wealth\, [www
 .monaiwealth.com](www.monaiwealth.com)\n* **Keith Wood**\, KW Property Ser
 vices\, [www.kwpropertyserviceslandscape.ca](www.kwpropertyserviceslandsca
 pe.ca)\n* **Michelina Dos Santos and Sonya Sokoliuk**\, The Mortgage Coach
 \, [https://themortgagecoach.ca](https://themortgagecoach.ca)\n* **Muhamma
 d Khan**\, CFOs in Action\, [www.cfosinaction.com](www.cfosinaction.com)\n
 * **Nile Saïd**\, GoOneUp\, [https://gooneup.co](https://gooneup.co)\n* *
 *Sonia Kurmey**\, Arbonne\, [www.soniakurmey.arbonne.com](www.soniakurmey.
 arbonne.com)\n* **Svetlana Ratnikova**\, IWB Immigrant Women in Business\,
  [https://immigrantwomeninbusiness](https://immigrantwomeninbusiness)
